 "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm great, thanks. How are you?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pretty good"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "okay; not bad"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm pretty good, but a bit tired."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "friend"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person you know and like"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Mika is my friend."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to exercise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move your body for health"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't have time to exercise."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Verb to be in Questions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "To ask questions with the verb<span class = \"strong\"> to be</span>, you change the order of the subject and the verb. There is no short form.  The answer to these questions is always Yes or No."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Am I in this class?"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"5\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Verb to be</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Subject</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Am\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Is\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"he ... ?<br/>she ... ?<br/>it ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"we ... ?<br/>they ... ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Is he your brother?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Are they from Australia?"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Are you a new student?"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Verb to be - Negative"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "To make the negative form of the verb <span class = \"strong\">to be</span>, you put the word<span class = \"strong\"> not</span> after the verb. Sometimes there are two short forms."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"4\",\"columns\":\"3\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Long Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Short Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Examples</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I'm not tired.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He is not<br/>She is not<br/>It is not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He's not/He isn't <br/> She's not/She isn't <br/> It's not/It isn't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">He isn't here.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We are not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We're not/We aren't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">They aren't in the class</span>.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le01ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find 3 people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask how they are."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask questions to get personal information. Ask questions like: <span class=\"italic\">Where do you live? Do you exercise? What do you do?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Complete the table."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Personal Information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" &nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  &nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  &nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write the name."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write the information in the table."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use the verb <span class=\"italic\">to be</span>."}]}]}